For each decisive unknown that can be resolved, specify the least-risk documentary clarification, sample inspection, or approved test and set its acceptance criteria before results arrive. Identify an accepting technical role and exact candidate revision. A sample test does not qualify variable production lots unless the supplied lot-acceptance rule authorizes the inference.
